OL,3,AUK to review Chagos Islands deal over
OL,4,Alack of US support, Streeting tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK is reviewing its deal to hand
OL,7,Fover the Chagos Islands to Mauritius,
OL,8,Fthe defence secretary has said.
OL,10,FWes Streeting confirmed the deal was
OL,11,Fbeing looked at again after US
OL,12,FPresident Donald Trump called it
OL,13,F"terrible" at the UN General Assembly
OL,14,Fon Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe original agreement would see the UK
OL,17,Fcede sovereignty of the territory to
OL,18,FMauritius and pay an average of #101m
OL,19,F($136m) per year to lease back a joint
OL,20,FUK-US military base there, prized for
OL,21,Fits strategic location in the Indian
OL,22,FOcean.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
