OL,3,ADrug deaths rise sharply in Scotland as
OL,4,Afigures remain worst in Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FNRS defines drug-related deaths as
OL,7,Fthose where the underlying cause was
OL,8,Fdrug poisoning, a controlled substance
OL,9,Fwas in the body at the time of death,
OL,10,Fand drug use led directly to the death.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
