OL,3,AReports of violence against women in
OL,4,AGaza surge, UN agency finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a sharp rise in reports
OL,7,Fof violence against women and girls in
OL,8,Fthe Gaza Strip, including early and
OL,9,Fforced marriage, according to a series
OL,10,Fof recent reports from the UN
OL,11,FPopulation Fund (UNFPA).
OL,13,FOne report, which analyses data
OL,14,Fcollected by 10 organisations, says the
OL,15,Fprotracted crisis in war-torn Gaza has
OL,16,F"created conditions in which women and
OL,17,Fgirls face escalating risks of
OL,18,Fgender-based violence".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11910
SC,0010
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790162768
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AReports of violence against women in
OL,4,AGaza surge, UN agency finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also warns that there has been a
OL,7,F"severe escalation" in the number of
OL,8,Fearly and forced marriage incidents in
OL,9,Fthe second quarter of this year. Both
OL,10,Fare considered types of gender-based
OL,11,Fviolence (GBV) by the UN.
OL,13,FAnother report presenting testimony
OL,14,Ffrom 230 women in crowded displacement
OL,15,Fcamps in Gaza City and Khan Younis
OL,16,Fmakes for a grim read, describing the
OL,17,Fviolence they have experienced or
OL,18,Fwitnessed.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
