OL,3,AEleven killed in mass shooting at house
OL,4,Ain South Africa
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said some of the victims were on
OL,7,Ftheir watch in connection with illegal
OL,8,Factivities, which they could not
OL,9,F"divulge at the moment to protect
OL,10,Finvestigations which have been
OL,11,Flaunched".
OL,13,FWhile the motive of the shooting has
OL,14,Fnot yet confirmed, the police said they
OL,15,Fcould not rule out a "feud between
OL,16,Frival groupings".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
