OL,3,ATrump administration accuses banned
OL,4,Amedia outlets of 'falsehoods' ahead of
OL,5,Acourt hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US Justice Department has filed
OL,8,Fdocuments that accuse three media
OL,9,Foutlets banned from the White House of
OL,10,F"trafficking in verifiable falsehoods"
OL,11,Fand reporting which "threatened
OL,12,Fnational security" as it prepared to
OL,13,Fdefend the move in court.
OL,15,FLast week, President Donald Trump
OL,16,Fbarred CNN, Politico and MS NOW from
OL,17,Fthe White House, accusing them of
OL,18,Fspreading "fake news".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
