OL,3,ATrump administration accuses banned
OL,4,Amedia outlets of 'falsehoods' ahead of
OL,5,Acourt hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter their reporters had their passes
OL,8,Fconfiscated and were denied access to
OL,9,Fthe building, the three outlets jointly
OL,10,Flaunched legal action, calling the move
OL,11,Funconstitutional.
OL,13,FOn Wednesday, a judge is set to decide
OL,14,Fwhether to issue an order temporarily
OL,15,Flifting the ban, pending a full
OL,16,Fhearing.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
